        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "One AsyncSession shared across `asyncio.gather` is **not** task-safe",
            "`s.commit()` without `await` means the coroutine never runs",
            "Lazy attribute access after commit raises MissingGreenlet",
            "`execute()` on huge results loads every row; `stream()` instead",
            "No `engine.dispose()` at shutdown leaves connections open"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "Rule of thumb",
          "text": "__One session per request or task__. Share the engine and the sessionmaker; never share a session. Lazy loading traps are on p.7."
        },
