          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`s.begin()` → **COMMIT** on clean exit, ==ROLLBACK== on error",
            "`add()` only stages; the INSERT runs at flush",
            "`s.get()` checks the ==identity map== before querying",
            "`scalars()` unwraps rows into ORM objects"
